# ── Audit archive ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local-only. Holds ten full tarball copies of the question bank plus every
# intermediate dump from the Oct 2026 ETS-fidelity audit (~53 MB). Committing it
# would publish the entire pro bank several times over, permanently, in history.
_ets_audit_archive_*/
_ets_audit_tmp/
_removed_from_free_*/

# Bank backups and payload dumps — same reason
bank_backup_*.tar.gz
bank_free_backup_*.tar.gz
ets_audit_verdicts_*.tar.gz
*_apply_payload.json
*_change_log.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db

# ── Pro question data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The repo is PUBLIC and the site is static, so anything committed here is downloadable
# by anyone. Pro questions and Pro mocks are served to paying students from Cloudflare KV
# through the Worker (POST /pro-data) and stay local-only. If they are still tracked,
# untrack them (keeps the files on disk):  git rm -r --cached pro/bank pro/mocks
pro/bank/
pro/mocks/
